# Architecture Guardrail

The architecture is LOCKED.

Cursor is an implementation tool.

Not an architect.

Never:

- move ownership
- merge modules
- split modules
- duplicate business logic
- duplicate state
- bypass SSOT

If a requested change violates architecture:

STOP

Identify:

- owning module
- violated rule
- compliant implementation

Never silently redesign the database.

Migration history must remain intact.